Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:26:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Paint range inputs using their value and accent

Seed and update range values, paint the track and thumb, apply computed accent-color to controls, and rewrite legacy thumb colors in place within their CSS group. Closed select arrows are already provided by our select patch.

Co-authored-by: hotty Agent <hotty@neuroplast.io>
